{"headword":"מַסֵּכָה³","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. 1. libation</strong>; <strong>2. molten metal</strong>, or <strong>image</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:4\" href=\"/Exodus.32.4\">Ex 32:4</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסֵּכַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.22\">Is 30:22</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסֵּכוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.9\">1 K 14:9</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַסֵּכֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:52\" href=\"/Numbers.33.52\">Nu 33:52</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>libation</em>, with covenant sacrif. in making covenant <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.1\">Is 30:1</a> (= <strong>1.</strong> <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶסֶךְ</span>; see, however, sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, נָסַךְ²\" href=\"/BDB,_נָסַךְ²\", dir=\"rtl\">II.</a> [<a data-ref=\"BDB, נָסַךְ²\" href=\"/BDB,_נָסַךְ²\", dir=\"rtl\">נָסַךְ</a>])."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>molten metal</em>, or <em>image:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵגֶל מַסֵּכָה</span> <em>molten calf</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:4\" href=\"/Exodus.32.4\">Ex 32:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 32:8\" href=\"/Exodus.32.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.16\">Dt 9:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:18\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.18\">Ne 9:18</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 106:19\" href=\"/Psalms.106.19\">ψ 106:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֱלֹהֵי מַסֵּכָה</span> <em>molten gods</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:17\" href=\"/Exodus.34.17\">Ex 34:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.4\">Lv 19:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">צַלְמֵי מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 33:52\" href=\"/Numbers.33.52\">Nu 33:52</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּסֶל וּמַסֵּכָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.15\">Dt 27:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:3\" href=\"/Judges.17.3\">Ju 17:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:4\" href=\"/Judges.17.4\">4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:14\" href=\"/Judges.18.14\">18:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:14\" href=\"/Nahum.1.14\">Na 1:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:3\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.3\">2 Ch 34:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:4\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.4\">4</a>, elsewhere (variously) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 9:12\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.9.12\">Dt 9:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:17\" href=\"/Judges.18.17\">Ju 18:17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 18:18\" href=\"/Judges.18.18\">18</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.9\">1 K 14:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 17:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.17.16\">2 K 17:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 28:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.28.2\">2 Ch 28:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.22\">Is 30:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.17\">42:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:2\" href=\"/Hosea.13.2\">Ho 13:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:18\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.18\">Hb 2:18</a>."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB06361","strong_numbers":["4541"],"next_hw":"נָסַךְ²","prev_hw":"נָסִיךְ","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I.","quotes":[],"GK":["5011","5012","5013"],"TWOT":["1375c","1376a"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}